# Every text file is stored AND checked out with LF line endings, on every OS (even with core.autocrlf=true).
# Why: DVC fingerprints code files byte by byte, so CRLF on a Windows clone would make `dvc status`
# report the pipeline code as "modified" even though nothing changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch binary files
*.parquet binary
*.npy binary
*.png binary
